tools.example:
Application Library: Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Mixing_and_Separation/liquid_chromatography (Langmuir adsorption in a packed column) and Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Tutorials/monolith_reactor.
model.component("comp1").physics().create("tds", "DilutedSpeciesInPorousMedia", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").field("concentration").component(new String[]{"c1", "c2"});
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").prop("TransportMechanism").set("DispersionInPorousMedia", "1");

Application Library: Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Reactors_with_Porous_Catalysts/porous_reactor (Rh surface chemistry in a porous catalyst) and Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Reactors_with_Mass_Transfer/drug_release.
model.component("comp1").physics().create("tds", "DilutedSpeciesInPorousCatalysts", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("cat1").set("Sarea", "cat_area");

Application Library: Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Electrokinetic_Effects/electroosmotic_flow (migration in an electric field).
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").prop("TransportMechanism").set("Convection", "1");
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").prop("TransportMechanism").set("Migration", "1");

Application Library: CFD_Module/Single-Phase_Flow/turbulent_mixing (baffle modelled as thin barrier).
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").create("tib1", "ThinImpermeableBarrier", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("tib1").selection().set(new int[]{12});

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Batteries,_General/li_air_battery_1d (oxygen transport coupled to the porous cathode).
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").create("pec1", "PorousElectrodeCoupling", 1);
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("pec1").feature("rc1").set("iv_src", "root.comp1.liion.pce1.per1.iv");

Application Library: Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Mixing_and_Separation/liquid_chromatography.
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("porous1").create("ads1", "Adsorptions", 1);
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("porous1").feature("ads1").set("SorptionType", "Langmuir");
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("porous1").feature("ads1").set("KL", new String[]{"K1", "K2"});
model.component("comp1").physics("tds").feature("porous1").feature("ads1").set("cPmax", new String[]{"S*n01", "S*n02"});

Application Library: Chemical_Reaction_Engineering_Module/Mixing_and_Separation/stefan_tube.
model.component("comp1").physics("tcs").create("mf1", "MassFraction", 0);
model.component("comp1").physics("tcs").feature("mf1").set("species", new String[]{"1", "1", "0"});
model.component("comp1").physics("tcs").feature("mf1").set("wbnd", new String[]{"w_ace0", "w_met0", "0"});
